text.section:
The certification program for wetland delineation set forth in this chapter shall be voluntary and shall not be construed to prohibit:

The practice of wetland delineation by individuals who are not certified professional wetland delineators as defined in this chapter;


The work of an employee or a subordinate of a certified professional wetland delineator or of an individual who is practicing wetland delineation without being certified;


The work of any professional engineer, landscape architect, or land surveyor as defined by § 54.1-400 in rendering any of the services that constitute the practice of wetland delineation or the practice of soil evaluation; or


The practice of any profession or occupation that is regulated by another regulatory board within the Department.
